<section id="Sx1" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Checklist</h2>

<div id="Sx1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="Sx1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all models and algorithms presented, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A clear description of the mathematical setting, assumptions, algorithm, and/or model. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">An analysis of the properties and complexity (time, space, sample size) of any algorithm. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">(Optional) Anonymized source code, with specification of all dependencies, including external libraries. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For any theoretical claim, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Statements of the full set of assumptions of all theoretical results. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Complete proofs of all theoretical results. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Clear explanations of any assumptions. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all figures and tables that present empirical results, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The code, data, and instructions needed to reproduce the main experimental results (either in the supplemental material or as a URL). [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All the training details (e.g., data splits, hyperparameters, how they were chosen). [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A clear definition of the specific measure or statistics and error bars (e.g., with respect to the random seed after running experiments multiple times). [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">No</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A description of the computing infrastructure used. (e.g., type of GPUs, internal cluster, or cloud provider). [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i3.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">No</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If you are using existing assets (e.g., code, data, models) or curating/releasing new assets, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Citations of the creator If your work uses existing assets. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The license information of the assets, if applicable. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">New assets either in the supplemental material or as a URL, if applicable. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Information about consent from data providers/curators. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(e)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Discussion of sensible content if applicable, e.g., personally identifiable information or offensive content. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If you used crowdsourcing or conducted research with human subjects, check if you include:</p>
<ol id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The full text of instructions given to participants and screenshots. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Descriptions of potential participant risks, with links to Institutional Review Board (IRB) approvals if applicable. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The estimated hourly wage paid to participants and the total amount spent on participant compensation. [Yes/No/Not Applicable] <span id="Sx1.I1.i5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Not Applicable</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:4.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<div id="Sx1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center">
<p id="Sx1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Supplementary Materials</span></p>
</div><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 4 MAIN RESULT: SEQUENTIAL FEATURE LEARNING" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proof Outline</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialization Property.</span> At initialization, the following property needs to be satisfied.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmcond1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_cond">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmcond1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Condition 1</span></span><span id="Thmcond1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Initialization)<span id="Thmcond1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmcond1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmcond1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmcond1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">At initialization <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)\right\}_{i=1}^{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)\right\}_{i=1}^{m}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)\right\}_{i=1}^{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)\right\}_{i=1}^{m}</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell+1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell+1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell+1}^{\star}}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell+1}^{\star}}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\right)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(0)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}\right)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2},\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}\in\left[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2},\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}\in\left[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}^{\star}\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}(0)\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">. Moreover, </span><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}(0)^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="Thmcond1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmcond1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{1}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{mm^{\star}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{1}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{mm^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math> for some absolute constant <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1},\beta_{3}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1},\beta_{3}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{2}\leq o(1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{2}\leq o(1)</annotation></semantics></math> and any <math id="Thmcond1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{7}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.3em"><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:-0.15em;" lspace="-0.1em" width="-0.15em"><mo stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo></mpadded><mn mathsize="0.700em">7</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{7}})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">By Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ 4.1 Guided by the Experts: A Proof Sketch of Theorem ‣ 4 MAIN RESULT: SEQUENTIAL FEATURE LEARNING" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ A.2 Initialization Property ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, the above condition holds with probability at least <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-7\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-7\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> as long as <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inductive Hypothesis.</span>
Now we are going to show that <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math> converges to at least <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\frac{c}{\sqrt{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\frac{c}{\sqrt{d}}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math> by induction. To start, we denote the values of interest as follows</p>
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{gathered}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\\
I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}(t);\quad I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}(t);\quad I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}(t)\end{gathered}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{gathered}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star};\quad\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\\
I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}(t);\quad I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}(t);\quad I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)=\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}(t)\end{gathered}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.2" class="ltx_p">To state the inductive hypothesis, we need the following error bounds.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefin1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_defin">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefin1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 1</span></span><span id="Thmdefin1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Error Bounds)<span id="Thmdefin1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefin1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmdefin1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For each <math id="Thmdefin1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we define the following:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_gather ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{2,\ell}(t):=\max_{j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell}^{\star}\}}\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j}^{(1)}(t)\right|;" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{2,\ell}(t):=\max_{j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell}^{\star}\}}\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j}^{(1)}(t)\right|;</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{3,\ell}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{4,\ell}(t):=\max_{j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell}^{\star}\}}\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j}^{(2)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t):=\left|I_{i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(3)}(t)\right|" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{3,\ell}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{4,\ell}(t):=\max_{j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell}^{\star}\}}\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j}^{(2)}(t)\right|;\;\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t):=\left|I_{i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(3)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefin1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Moreover, we also define the forward error, the backward error, and the aggregated error as</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_gather ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t)\right\};\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t),\varepsilon_{2,\ell}(t)\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t)\right\};\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t),\varepsilon_{2,\ell}(t)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t)\right\};\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t)\right\};\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{4,\ell}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)\right\};\;\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\max\left\{\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t),\varepsilon_{3,\ell}(t)\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\max\left\{\varepsilon_{4,\ell}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)\right\};\;\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\max\left\{\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t),\varepsilon_{1,\ell}(t),\varepsilon_{3,\ell}(t)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefin1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmdefin1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,3}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,3}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmdefin1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t),\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> are defined as</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_gather ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t):=\max_{\ell^{\prime}\leq\ell,j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star}\}}\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star},j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star},j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\};" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,1}(t):=\max_{\ell^{\prime}\leq\ell,j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\{j_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star}\}}\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star},j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i_{\ell^{\prime}}^{\star},j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\};</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t):=\max_{i\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell,2}(t):=\max_{i\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,1}(t):=\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t):=\max_{i,j\in[m],i\neq j}\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell,2}(t):=\max_{i,j\in[m],i\neq j}\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefin1.p1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin1.p1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lastly, we are going to define the monotonic upper bound of <math id="Thmdefin1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmdefin1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex45" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\sup_{t^{\prime}\in[0,t]}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t);\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\sup_{t^{\prime}\in[0,t]}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">sup</mo><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)=\sup_{t^{\prime}\in[0,t]}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t);\;\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)=\sup_{t^{\prime}\in[0,t]}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefin2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_defin">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefin2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 2</span></span><span id="Thmdefin2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Recovery Time)<span id="Thmdefin2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefin2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmdefin2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Define the <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ξ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi</annotation></semantics></math>-recovery time of <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>, denoted as <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}\left(\xi\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}\left(\xi\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, as</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex46" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}\left(\xi\right)=\min\left\{t\geq 0:\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq\xi\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}\left(\xi\right)=\min\left\{t\geq 0:\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq\xi\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefin2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefin2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Based on <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}(\xi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}(\xi)</annotation></semantics></math>, we define the <span id="Thmdefin2.p1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">constant-recovery time</span> and the <span id="Thmdefin2.p1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">near-perfect-recovery time</span> as <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{r,\ell}=T_{\ell}\left(0.9\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{r,\ell}=T_{\ell}\left(0.9\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmdefin2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{p,\ell}=T_{\ell}\left(1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{p,\ell}=T_{\ell}\left(1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmcond2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_cond">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmcond2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Condition 2</span></span><span id="Thmcond2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Inductive Hypothesis)<span id="Thmcond2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmcond2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmcond2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmcond2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmcond2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>. Then we have that</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Sequential recovery) For all </span><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq T_{p,\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq T_{p,\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> such that </span><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> we have </span><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\prime\star},j_{\ell}^{\prime\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mo>′</mo><mo lspace="0.222em">⁣</mo><mo>⋆</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mo>′</mo><mo lspace="0.222em">⁣</mo><mo>⋆</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\prime\star},j_{\ell}^{\prime\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, and </span><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\prime\star},j_{\ell}^{\prime\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq 1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mo>′</mo><mo lspace="0.222em">⁣</mo><mo>⋆</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mo>′</mo><mo lspace="0.222em">⁣</mo><mo>⋆</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\prime\star},j_{\ell}^{\prime\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq 1-\frac{\beta_{9}m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell^{\prime}&lt;\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell^{\prime}&lt;\ell</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Error bound of </span><math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)},\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)},\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">) For </span><math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{p,\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{p,\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex47" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\frac{\beta_{6}m^{2}}{\sqrt{d}}\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]}\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\frac{\beta_{6}m^{2}}{\sqrt{d}}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Error bound of remaining items) </span><math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{F},\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> such that </span><math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(1)}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="Thmcond2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmcond2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Here <math id="Thmcond2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{6},\beta_{9}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{6},\beta_{9}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> are some absolute constant.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The proof proceeds by establishing the inductive hypothesis.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Initialization Property</h3>

<div id="Thmlemma3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 3</span></span><span id="Thmlemma3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{1},\dots,\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{1},\dots,\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{1},\dots,{\mathbf{w}}_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{1},\dots,{\mathbf{w}}_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> be I.I.D. random vectors from <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}\left(\bm{0},d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}\left(\bm{0},d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Define <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}=\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}=\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then there exists some absolute constant <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1},\beta_{3},\beta_{5}&gt;0,\beta_{2}\leq o\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1},\beta_{3},\beta_{5}&gt;0,\beta_{2}\leq o\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{3}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.3em"><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:-0.15em;" lspace="-0.1em" width="-0.15em"><mo stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo></mpadded><mn mathsize="0.700em">3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{3}})</annotation></semantics></math> such that if <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{1}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{m^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{1}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{m^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-3\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-3\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> we have that</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I3.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">;</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I3.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">;</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I3.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right)^{2},\left({\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right)^{2}\right\}\leq\frac{\beta_{3}}{d}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I3.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> with </span><math id="A1.I3.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Our proof starts with showing the concentration for <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, and then moves to the proof of the desired statement.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Concentration of <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Let <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\bm{0},d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\bm{0},d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Then <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}[i]\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}[i]\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d{\mathbf{v}}[i]^{2}\in\texttt{subE}\left(2,2\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">subE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d{\mathbf{v}}[i]^{2}\in\texttt{subE}\left(2,2\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Since <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}[i]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}[i]</annotation></semantics></math>’s are I.I.D., we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex48" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}=d\sum_{i=1}^{d}{\mathbf{v}}[i]^{2}\in\texttt{subE}\left(2d,2\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">subE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}=d\sum_{i=1}^{d}{\mathbf{v}}[i]^{2}\in\texttt{subE}\left(2d,2\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, by the tail bound of sub-exponential random variables, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex49" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(\left|\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-1\right|\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)=\Pr\left(\left|d\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-d\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\right.}{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\right]}\right|\geq t\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{4}\min\left\{\frac{t^{2}}{d},t\right\}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>min</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(\left|\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-1\right|\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)=\Pr\left(\left|d\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-d\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\right.}{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\right]}\right|\geq t\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{4}\min\left\{\frac{t^{2}}{d},t\right\}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">We are going to focus on the case where <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq d</annotation></semantics></math>. In particular, we set <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}d</annotation></semantics></math>. Then we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex50" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(\left|\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-1\right|\geq\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{16}\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}d\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(\left|\left\|{\mathbf{v}}\right\|_{2}^{2}-1\right|\geq\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{16}\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}d\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Take a union bound over all <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> gives that, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-4m\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{16}\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}d\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-4m\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{16}\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}d\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex51" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in\left[1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2},\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in\left[1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">Setting <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq\frac{16}{\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}}\log\frac{4m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq\frac{16}{\beta_{2}^{2}\delta_{s}^{2}}\log\frac{4m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> guarantees that the failing probability is within <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Concentration of <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j},\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j},\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Due to the independence between <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>’s and <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>’s, we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex52" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\right.}{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\right]}=0;\quad d\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[\ell]{\mathbf{w}}_{j}[\ell]\in\texttt{subE}\left(1,1\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">subE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\right.}{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}}\right]}=0;\quad d\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[\ell]{\mathbf{w}}_{j}[\ell]\in\texttt{subE}\left(1,1\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\texttt{subE}\left(d,1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">subE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\texttt{subE}\left(d,1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Applying the tail bound of sub-exponential random variable gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex53" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)=\Pr\left(d\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\geq t\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\min\left\{\frac{t^{2}}{d},t\right\}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>min</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)=\Pr\left(d\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\geq t\right)\leq 2\text{exp}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\min\left\{\frac{t^{2}}{d},t\right\}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">The same concentration also holds for <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. Again we are going to focus on the case <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq d</annotation></semantics></math>. Take a union bound over all <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex54" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(\max\left\{\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|,\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\right\}\geq\frac{t}{d};\;\forall i,j\in[m]\right)\leq 8m^{2}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t^{2}}{2d}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(\max\left\{\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|,\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\right\}\geq\frac{t}{d};\;\forall i,j\in[m]\right)\leq 8m^{2}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t^{2}}{2d}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">Setting the failing probability to <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives that with probability at least <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex55" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j},\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},-\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j},\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j},{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},-\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the first statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Notice that the bound for <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is already implied by its concentration property. To prove the bound for <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we write</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\|\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}=\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\|\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}=\left\|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">By the concentration property of <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex57" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta{\mathbb{P}}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ℙ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq\frac{2}{\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq\frac{2}{\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}\leq\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}\right\|_{i}^{2}}\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)^{2}\leq\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>. Combined with the concentration property of <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\in[1-\beta_{2}\delta_{s},1+\beta_{2}\delta_{s}]</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of second statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
By the tail bound of Gaussian random variable, we have that for all <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex58" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(z^{2}\geq t\right)=2\Pr\left(z\geq\sqrt{t}\right)\leq\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t}{2}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(z^{2}\geq t\right)=2\Pr\left(z\geq\sqrt{t}\right)\leq\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">Apply the above to <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z=\sqrt{d}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=\sqrt{d}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{d}\cdot\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{d}\cdot\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]</annotation></semantics></math> with a union bound over all <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math> gives</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex59" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(\max_{i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]^{2}\geq\frac{t}{d};\;\max_{i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)\leq 2mm^{\star}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t}{2}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(\max_{i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]^{2}\geq\frac{t}{d};\;\max_{i\in[m],j\in[m^{\star}]}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}\geq\frac{t}{d}\right)\leq 2mm^{\star}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{t}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text">Set <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\frac{\beta_{3}}{4}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq 2\log\frac{2mm^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\frac{\beta_{3}}{4}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq 2\log\frac{2mm^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives the desired result for <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>s. To bound <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we notice that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex60" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]\right|+\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right|" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]\right|+\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.4.1" class="ltx_text">By the previous bounds, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex61" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right);\;\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\cdot\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right);\;\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right|\leq\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{2}\delta_{s}\right)}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\cdot\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.5.1" class="ltx_text">With <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> we can guarantee that the latter is also upper bounded by <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{2\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Combining the two bounds and square both sides gives the desired result for <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}[j]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the third statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The bound of <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> is again implied by the concentration we showed above. To show the bound of <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, we write</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex62.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex62.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex63"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex63.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}+\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊤</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}+\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">By the concentration of the norms and inner-products, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_gather ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex64"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex64.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right|\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊤</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right|\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\leq\frac{1}{d^{\frac{3}{2}}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)^{2}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{3}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\leq\frac{1}{d^{\frac{3}{2}}\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)^{2}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{3}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">With the condition <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\frac{\beta_{5}m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math> we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex66" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)^{2}}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\leq\frac{1}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq 1" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)^{2}}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\leq\frac{1}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, we can conclude that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex67" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊤</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\top\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right|,\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right\|_{2}^{2}}\left|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text">Combined with the bound on <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex68" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{v}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.6.1" class="ltx_text">Squaring both sides gives the desired result. Lastly, to bound <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, we write</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex69"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex69.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex69.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathbf{w}}_{j}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{I}}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}=\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}-\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.7.1" class="ltx_text">Similar to the above, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex70" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex70.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{\left\|{\mathbf{w}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}\hat{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\cdot{\mathbf{w}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\leq\frac{1}{d\left(1-\frac{1}{2}\beta_{s}\delta_{s}\right)}\log\frac{8m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{6\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.8.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, we can conclude that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex71" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{w}}_{j}\in\left[-\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}},\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.9.1" class="ltx_text">Squaring both sides gives the desired result.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4</span></span><span id="Thmlemma4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">[Restatement of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ 4.1 Guided by the Experts: A Proof Sketch of Theorem ‣ 4 MAIN RESULT: SEQUENTIAL FEATURE LEARNING" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>]
Let <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{1},\dots,{\mathbf{w}}_{m}\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{1},\dots,{\mathbf{w}}_{m}\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}{\mathbf{I}}_{d}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> be I.I.D. Gaussian random vectors. Define</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex72" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex72.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}=\argmax_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j];\;\;\mathcal{R}_{\ell}=\{i_{k}^{\star}\}_{k=1}^{\ell};\;\;\mathcal{C}_{\ell}=\{j_{k}^{\star}\}_{k=1}^{\ell}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.727em">;</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.727em">;</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}=\argmax_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}}{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j];\;\;\mathcal{R}_{\ell}=\{i_{k}^{\star}\}_{k=1}^{\ell};\;\;\mathcal{C}_{\ell}=\{j_{k}^{\star}\}_{k=1}^{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let any <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{2}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.3em"><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:-0.15em;" lspace="-0.1em" width="-0.15em"><mo stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo></mpadded><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{2}})</annotation></semantics></math> be given. Then there exists some absolute constant <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{2},\beta_{4}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{2},\beta_{4}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> such that if <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, then for <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{2}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{m^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}=\frac{\beta_{2}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{m^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-4\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-4\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Row-wise Gap) </span><math id="A1.I4.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I4.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I4.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Column-wise Gap) </span><math id="A1.I4.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I4.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="A1.I4.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Threshold Gap) </span><math id="A1.I4.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell+1}}[j^{\star}_{\ell+1}]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq\left(1+2\delta_{s}\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell+1}}[j^{\star}_{\ell+1}]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I4.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Magnitude Lower Bound) </span><math id="A1.I4.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{v}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{v}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> for all </span><math id="A1.I4.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">We start by proving an auxiliary result that, with high probability, there are at least <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{m}{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{m}{3}</annotation></semantics></math> out of the m <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]</annotation></semantics></math>’s that are positive for each <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m]^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m]^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>. Define</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex73" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex73.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="s_{i,j}=\mathbb{I}\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]&gt;0\right\};\;S_{j}=\sum_{i=1}^{m}s_{i,j}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i,j}=\mathbb{I}\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]&gt;0\right\};\;S_{j}=\sum_{i=1}^{m}s_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">Due to the symmetry of Gaussian, we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i,j}\sim\texttt{Bern}\left(0.5\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Bern</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i,j}\sim\texttt{Bern}\left(0.5\right)</annotation></semantics></math> independently. Therefore, <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{S_{j}}\right.}{S_{j}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{S_{j}}\right]}=\frac{m}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{S_{j}}\right.}{S_{j}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{S_{j}}\right]}=\frac{m}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. By Hoeffding’s inequality, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex74" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left(S_{j}-\frac{m}{2}\leq-t\right)\leq\text{exp}\left(-\frac{2t^{2}}{m}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(S_{j}-\frac{m}{2}\leq-t\right)\leq\text{exp}\left(-\frac{2t^{2}}{m}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text">Setting <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\frac{m}{6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\frac{m}{6}</annotation></semantics></math> and take a union bound over all <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math> gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex75" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex75.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Pr\left(S_{j}\geq\frac{m}{3};\;\forall j\in[m^{\star}]\right)\leq m^{\star}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{m}{18}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mtext>exp</mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left(S_{j}\geq\frac{m}{3};\;\forall j\in[m^{\star}]\right)\leq m^{\star}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{m}{18}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.4.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq 18\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq\beta_{4}m^{\star}\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\geq 18\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, with probability at least <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that at least <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{m}{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{m}{3}</annotation></semantics></math> out of <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right\}_{i=1}^{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j]\right\}_{i=1}^{m}</annotation></semantics></math> are positive for all <math id="A1.SS2.p7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the first statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Let any <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{1},i_{2}\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{1},i_{2}\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j_{1},j_{2}\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j_{1},j_{2}\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i_{1},j_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i_{1},j_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i_{2},j_{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i_{2},j_{2})</annotation></semantics></math> differ in at least one coordinate. Then we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]</annotation></semantics></math> are I.I.D. Gaussian random variables in <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}\left(0,d^{-1}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math> is a standard Cauchy random variable. Given the condition that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]</annotation></semantics></math> are half-Gaussian, and thus <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math> is half-Cauchy. Using the CDF of Cauchy random variables, we have that for any <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{2}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.3em"><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:-0.15em;" lspace="-0.1em" width="-0.15em"><mo stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo></mpadded><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta\in(0,\nicefrac{{1}}{{2}})</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex76"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex76.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\right)\mid{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\geq 0\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\right)\mid{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}],{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]\geq 0\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex77"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex77.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\Pr\left(\left|\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}\right|\in(1,1+\delta)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="3.278em">=</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\Pr\left(\left|\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}\right|\in(1,1+\delta)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex78"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex78.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=2\Pr\left(\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}\in(1,1+\delta)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="3.278em">=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=2\Pr\left(\frac{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{1}}[j_{1}]}{{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{2}}[j_{2}]}\in(1,1+\delta)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex79"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex79.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\frac{2}{\pi}\left(\arctan\left(1+\delta\right)-\arctan 1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="3.278em">=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\frac{2}{\pi}\left(\arctan\left(1+\delta\right)-\arctan 1\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex80"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex80.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\frac{2}{\pi}\arctan\frac{\delta}{2+\delta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="3.278em">=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad=\frac{2}{\pi}\arctan\frac{\delta}{2+\delta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex81"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex81.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad\leq\frac{\delta}{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="3.278em">≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad\leq\frac{\delta}{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality follows from <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arctan x\leq x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arctan x\leq x</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.
To prove the first property, we let <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j_{1}=j_{\ell}^{\star},j_{2}=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j_{1}=j_{\ell}^{\star},j_{2}=j</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{1}=i_{2}=i_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{1}=i_{2}=i_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>. Fix any <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex82" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex82.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]\right);\;\forall j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}\text{ s.t. }{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]\geq 0\right)\leq m^{\star}\delta" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mtext> s.t. </mtext><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]\right);\;\forall j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}\text{ s.t. }{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]\geq 0\right)\leq m^{\star}\delta</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p8.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p8.3.1" class="ltx_text">Recall that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j]</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math>. If <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, since by definition <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, it must hold that <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq(1+2\delta_{s}){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq(1+2\delta_{s}){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j]</annotation></semantics></math>. Take a union bound over <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and set <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=2\delta_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=2\delta_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS2.p8.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2mm^{\star}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2mm^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives the first property.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the second statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p9.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> To prove the second property, we set <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{1}=i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{2}=i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{1}=i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{2}=i</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j_{1}=j_{2}=j_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j_{1}=j_{2}=j_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>. Fix any <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex83" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex83.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\right);\;\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}\text{ s.t. }{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\geq 0\right)\leq m\delta" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mtext> s.t. </mtext><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\right);\;\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}\text{ s.t. }{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\geq 0\right)\leq m\delta</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">Recall that <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math>. If <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, since by definition <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, it must hold that <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq(1+2\delta_{s}){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq(1+2\delta_{s}){\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>. Take a union bound over <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and set <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=2\delta_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=2\delta_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2m^{\star 2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋆</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2m^{\star 2}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives the second property.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the third statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> To prove the third property, we set <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{1}=i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{2}=i_{\ell+1}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{1}=i_{\ell}^{\star},i_{2}=i_{\ell+1}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j_{1}=j_{\ell}^{\star},j_{1}=j_{\ell+1}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j_{1}=j_{\ell}^{\star},j_{1}=j_{\ell+1}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>. Fix any <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex84" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex84.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}]\right)\right)\leq\delta" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\in\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}],\left(1+\delta\right){\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}]\right)\right)\leq\delta</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">Recall that <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}]\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i^{\star}_{\ell}}[j^{\star}_{\ell}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell+1}^{\star}}[j_{\ell+1}^{\star}]\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]</annotation></semantics></math>. Take a union bound over <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}-1]</annotation></semantics></math>, and set <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=2\delta_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=2\delta_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2m^{\star}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{s}\leq\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}{2m^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives the third property.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof of the fourth statement.<span id="A1.SS2.p11.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> To show the last result, we notice that by definition of <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>, it must holds that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex85" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex85.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}];\quad\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]\geq{\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}];\quad\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.2.1" class="ltx_text">This gives that for any <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex86"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex86.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex86.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\prod_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\prod_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex87"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex87.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\prod_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\prod_{i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}}\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex88"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex88.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z&lt;\gamma\right)^{m-m^{\star}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z&lt;\gamma\right)^{m-m^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex89"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex89.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left(1-\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z\geq\gamma\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><munder><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left(1-\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z\geq\gamma\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.3.1" class="ltx_text">By the tail bound of Gaussian random variable, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex90" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex90.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z\geq\gamma\right)\geq\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>Pr</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr_{z\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)}\left(z\geq\gamma\right)\geq\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex91" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex91.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\leq\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]&lt;\frac{\gamma}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\leq\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.5.1" class="ltx_text">Take a union bound over all <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math> gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex92" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]^{2}\geq\frac{\gamma^{2}}{d}\right)\geq 1-m^{\star}\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr\left({\mathbf{w}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}[j_{\ell}^{\star}]^{2}\geq\frac{\gamma^{2}}{d}\right)\geq 1-m^{\star}\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{m-m^{\star}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.6.1" class="ltx_text">For the failing probability to be upper bounded by <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\mathbb{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\mathbb{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we simply need</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex93" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq m^{\star}+\frac{\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}}{\log\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{-1}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq m^{\star}+\frac{\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}}{\log\left(1-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma}\text{exp}\left(-\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\right)^{-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.7.1" class="ltx_text">Using <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log\frac{1}{x}\geq 1-x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log\frac{1}{x}\geq 1-x</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, it suffice to guarantee that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex94" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq m^{\star}+\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma\text{exp}\left(\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq m^{\star}+\sqrt{2\pi}\cdot\gamma\text{exp}\left(\frac{\gamma^{2}}{2}\right)\log\frac{m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p11.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p11.8.1" class="ltx_text">Setting <math id="A1.SS2.p11.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=\left(\log m^{\star}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=\left(\log m^{\star}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives the desired result.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Hermite Expansion of the Gradient and the Gradient Flow Dynamics</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Notice that the population MSE has the following form</p>
<table id="A1.Ex95" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}\right)=\frac{1}{2}\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right.}{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right]}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>𝐱</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}\right)=\frac{1}{2}\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right.}{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}-2f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)+f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where the last term is independent of <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\theta}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\theta}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>, and is thus omitted from our analysis. Consider the Hermite expansion of <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively</p>
<table id="A1.Ex96" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex96.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi\left(x\right)=\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}c_{k}He_{k}\left(x\right);\quad\sigma\left(x\right)=He_{3}\left(x\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\left(x\right)=\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}c_{k}He_{k}\left(x\right);\quad\sigma\left(x\right)=He_{3}\left(x\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{k}=\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{x\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,1\right)}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\right.}{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\right]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{k}=\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{x\sim\mathcal{N}\left(0,1\right)}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\right.}{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\pi^{(k)}\left(x\right)}\right]}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then we have that</p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex97"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex97.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex97.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i,j=1}^{m}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i,j=1}^{m}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex98"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex98.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star}{\mathbf{x}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)f\left(\bm{\theta}^{\star}{\mathbf{x}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex98.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{m}\sum_{j=1}^{m^{\star}}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{m}\sum_{j=1}^{m^{\star}}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.5" class="ltx_p">This gives that</p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex99"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex99.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex99.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2\sum_{j=1}^{m}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}\cdot He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}\right)\left({\mathbf{I}}-\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\frac{{\mathbf{x}}}{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐈</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2\sum_{j=1}^{m}\sum_{k,\ell=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}c_{\ell}}{k!\ell!}\cdot He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{3}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}\right)\left({\mathbf{I}}-\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\frac{{\mathbf{x}}}{\left\|{\mathbf{v}}_{i}\right\|_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Taking the expectation gives</p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex100"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex100.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right.}{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>𝐱</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right.}{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{\frac{\partial}{\partial{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}f\left(\bm{\theta},{\mathbf{x}}\right)^{2}}\right]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex101"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
