</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.8" class="ltx_p">For the gradient of <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{w}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{w}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, we can compute that</p>
<table id="A1.Ex109" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
