<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex122.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\right.}{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\right]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>𝐱</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">[</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathrm{\mathbb{E}}_{{\mathbf{x}}}\boldsymbol{\left[\vphantom{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\right.}{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\boldsymbol{\left.\vphantom{He_{k}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}\right)He_{\ell}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)He_{a}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}\right)He_{b}\left({\mathbf{x}}^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}^{\star}\right)}\right]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.14" class="ltx_p">and that <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)\right\|_{2}=a_{i},\left\|\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)\right\|_{2}=b_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{i}(t)\right\|_{2}=a_{i},\left\|\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{i}(t)\right\|_{2}=b_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
Then we have that</p>
