<p id="A1.SS3.p1.23" class="ltx_p">Lastly, the inner product between <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j},\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j},\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> can be written as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex165"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
