<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex270.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{cases}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)&amp;\text{ if }i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}\\
