<div id="A1.SS4.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Analysis of <math id="A1.SS4.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS4.p8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> To analyze <math id="A1.SS4.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>, we first compute that for <math id="A1.SS4.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex272"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
