<div id="A1.SS4.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Analysis of <math id="A1.SS4.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS4.p10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The analysis of <math id="A1.SS4.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> will be separated into two cases. First, regardless of the cases, we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx59" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex285"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
