<p id="A1.SS4.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">We first analyze the case <math id="A1.SS4.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=j</annotation></semantics></math>, and then we dive into <math id="A1.SS4.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>. In the case where <math id="A1.SS4.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=j</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
