<p id="A1.SS4.p11.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p11.3.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, for the case <math id="A1.SS4.p11.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=j</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx66" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

