<p id="A1.SS5.p4.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.7.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ξ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi</annotation></semantics></math> be given such that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math> By the lower bound that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex320" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex320.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)\geq\beta_{\text{temp}}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\geq 0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>temp</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)\geq\beta_{\text{temp}}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.8.1" class="ltx_text">for <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\beta_{5}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{6}m^{16}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\beta_{5}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{6}m^{16}</annotation></semantics></math> for some <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{temp}}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>temp</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{temp}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>. This shows that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\geq\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, and thus <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for the sane choice of <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. This shows the first property. Moreover, by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma5" title="Lemma 5. ‣ A.4 Approximating the Gradient Flow Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx71" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex321"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex321.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex321.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{4}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>±</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>±</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{4}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex322"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex322.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq 2\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\left(c_{0}^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq 2\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\left(c_{0}^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex323"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex323.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.9.1" class="ltx_text">as <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\beta_{5}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{6}m^{16}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\beta_{5}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{6}m^{16}</annotation></semantics></math>. This shows the second property. To lower bound <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>, we first write that, by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ A.4 Approximating the Gradient Flow Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx72" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex324"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex324.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex324.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{a_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{a_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex325"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex325.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{a_{i}^{2}}\left(1-\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{2}\right)\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},1}(t)\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>±</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>±</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{a_{i}^{2}}\left(1-\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{2}\right)\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},1}(t)\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\pm\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.10.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, we could notice that, since</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex326" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex326.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\geq c_{1}^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)\geq 0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\geq c_{1}^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.11.1" class="ltx_text">for <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\beta_{5}m^{14}\geq\beta_{5}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\beta_{5}m^{14}\geq\beta_{5}\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="footnote4" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup>
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">4</span>
                  
                  
                  
                since we require <math id="footnote4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq\frac{\beta_{4}\log m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq\frac{\beta_{4}\log m^{\star}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span>, we must have that for all <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, either <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, or</span></p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E16X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq 6\left(1-\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}-\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq 6\left(1-\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k+1}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)^{k}-\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{5,\ell}(t)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="4" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E16Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E16Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq c_{1}^{2}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq c_{1}^{2}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E16Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.12.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality follows from the fact that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex327" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex327.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\leq\left(\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)\leq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\leq\left(\frac{\log m^{\star}}{d}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\leq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)\leq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.13.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, for all <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\min\{T_{c},T_{c}^{\prime},T_{\ell}(\xi)\}</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math> we must have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex328" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex328.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(0)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\cdot t\geq-\frac{\sqrt{2\beta_{4}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(0)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\cdot t\geq-\frac{\sqrt{2\beta_{4}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.14.1" class="ltx_text">Choosing <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{6}\geq 4\sqrt{\beta_{4}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{6}\geq 4\sqrt{\beta_{4}}</annotation></semantics></math> gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex329" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex329.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{c^{\prime}}\geq\min\left\{T_{c},T_{\ell}(\xi),\Omega\left(\frac{d}{m^{7}}\right)\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{c^{\prime}}\geq\min\left\{T_{c},T_{\ell}(\xi),\Omega\left(\frac{d}{m^{7}}\right)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.15.1" class="ltx_text">Now we are going to lower bound <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}(\xi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}(\xi)</annotation></semantics></math>. When <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\geq\beta_{5}m^{15}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\geq\beta_{5}m^{15}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex330" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex330.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq\frac{18}{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq\frac{18}{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.16.1" class="ltx_text">Solving the differential equation gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex331" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex331.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t+T_{0})\geq\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(T_{0})^{-1}-\frac{18}{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)t\right)^{-1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t+T_{0})\geq\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(T_{0})^{-1}-\frac{18}{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi^{2}\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)t\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.17.1" class="ltx_text">for any <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{0}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{0}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t+T_{0}\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t+T_{0}\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>.
This gives that, if <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(\xi)\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(\xi)\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx73" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex332"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex332.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T_{\ell}(\xi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T_{\ell}(\xi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex332.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}{18}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)^{-1}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{-1}-\zeta^{-1}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}{18}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)^{-1}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{-1}-\zeta^{-1}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex333"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex333.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}{18}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)^{-1}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}^{2}}{18}\left(c_{0}^{2}\left(1-\xi\right)-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)^{-1}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.18.1" class="ltx_text">This shows the last two properties. Moreover, we have that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}(\frac{1}{2})\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\left(\frac{d}{\log m^{\star}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}(\frac{1}{2})\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\left(\frac{d}{\log m^{\star}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. However, at <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, by (<a href="#A1.E16" title="In Proof. ‣ A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>), we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx74" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex334"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex334.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq c_{1}^{2}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq c_{1}^{2}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)-\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{2}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p4.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p4.19.1" class="ltx_text">which implies that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq-\frac{\beta_{6}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)\geq-\frac{\beta_{6}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T_{\ell}(\xi)\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T_{\ell}(\xi)\right\}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ξ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(1-\xi^{2})^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(1-\xi^{2})^{-1}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(1\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, as long as <math id="A1.SS5.p4.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Upper bounding <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span> Here we are going to show that the growth of <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})</annotation></semantics></math> is slow in terms of when <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> reaches <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ξ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> is no bigger than <math id="A1.SS5.p5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma9" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 9</span></span><span id="Thmlemma9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose that the inductive hypothesis in Condition <a href="#Thmcond2" title="Condition 2 (Inductive Hypothesis). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, and the initialization condition in Condition <a href="#Thmcond1" title="Condition 1 (Initialization). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Let <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math> be defined in (<a href="#A1.E14" title="In A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>) and <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\ell}(\xi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\ell}(\xi)</annotation></semantics></math> in Definition <a href="#Thmdefin2" title="Definition 2 (Recovery Time). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. Then there exists some constant <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{7}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{7}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> such that for all <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)+\frac{\beta_{7}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}{m^{2}}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)+\frac{\beta_{7}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}{m^{2}}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq O\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq O\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS5.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ A.4 Approximating the Gradient Flow Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, we write out the dynamic of <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> as</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx75" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex335"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex335.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex335.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex336"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex336.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\frac{9}{b_{i}^{2}}\cdot\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}-\frac{9}{b_{i}^{2}}\cdot\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex337"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex337.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>±</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\pm\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">As shown in Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma8" title="Lemma 8. ‣ A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 0,\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}(t)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\geq 0,\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}(t)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx76" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex338"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex338.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex338.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left|\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\right|\cdot\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}-\frac{9}{b_{i}^{2}}\cdot\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo fence="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mo fence="false">|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mi>𝕀</mi><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left|\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)^{k}\right|\cdot\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}-\frac{9}{b_{i}^{2}}\cdot\hat{\lambda}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star},5}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\mathbb{I}\left\{i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex339"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex339.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\quad\quad+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex340"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex340.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|^{k}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{c_{k}^{2}}{k!}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|^{k}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex341"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex341.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality is because <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|\leq\varepsilon_{1}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|\leq\varepsilon_{1}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>. For any <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, we must have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex342" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex342.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma^{(2)}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}\right)\gamma^{(2)}_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, for any <math id="A1.SS5.p6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex343" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex343.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">Notice that <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math> must be upper bounded by <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> given by</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex344" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex344.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right);\quad\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)=\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{7}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right);\quad\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">Observe that for any <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> grows monotonically as <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)</annotation></semantics></math> grows. By the initialization property, we have that <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|\leq\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
We can observe that <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> increases as <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> becomes larger. Thus, it suffice to consider <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)=\frac{\sqrt{\beta_{3}}}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>. In this case,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex345" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex345.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\leq\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text">Solving the differential equation gives that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex346" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex346.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\leq\left(\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|^{-1}-\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)t\right)^{-1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\hat{\gamma}_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\leq\left(\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)\right|^{-1}-\frac{18}{b_{i}^{2}}\left(c_{0}^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{4}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}+\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)t\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p7.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p7.4.1" class="ltx_text">Recall that <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(1+\delta_{s})^{2}b_{i}^{2}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)^{2}\leq b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(1+\delta_{s})^{2}b_{i}^{2}\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(0)^{2}\leq b_{i_{\ell}^{\star}}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(0)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> by the initialization property. Thus, <math id="A1.SS5.p7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
