<p id="A1.SS5.p13.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.7.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{j,i}^{(3)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{j,i}^{(3)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>, when <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq T_{p,\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq T_{p,\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
