<p id="A1.SS5.p13.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.8.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, by the inductive hypothesis, we have that for <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{p,\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{p,\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
