<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex432.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{j,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{j,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p13.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gathering the results.<span id="A1.SS5.p13.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Defining <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> to be the maximum of <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j</annotation></semantics></math> bounded above excluding <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)=(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)=(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j</annotation></semantics></math> bounded above excluding <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Gathering the results, we have that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex433" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex433.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p13.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.10.1" class="ltx_text">for <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>. In the meantime, by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma9" title="Lemma 9. ‣ A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex434" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex434.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall\;t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)+\frac{\beta_{7}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}{m^{2}}\right\}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">∀</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall\;t\leq\min\left\{T_{c},T\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}}{d^{\frac{2}{5}}}\right)+\frac{\beta_{7}\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}{m^{2}}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p13.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.11.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1},j\in[m^{\star}]\setminus\mathcal{C}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)\neq(i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx101" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex435"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex435.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex435.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex436"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex436.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex437"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex437.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\right)\frac{d}{dt}\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p13.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.12.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality follows from Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma8" title="Lemma 8. ‣ A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. Solving the differential equation gives</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx102" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex438"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex438.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(0)\text{exp}\left(\mathcal{O}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\right)\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\text{exp}\left(\mathcal{O}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\right)\right)\cdot t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ε</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>exp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(t)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right)\hat{\varepsilon}_{\ell}(0)\text{exp}\left(\mathcal{O}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\right)\right)+\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)\text{exp}\left(\mathcal{O}\left(\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\right)\right)\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p13.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p13.13.1" class="ltx_text">Imposing <math id="A1.SS5.p13.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math> gives the desired result.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Fine-Grained Result for <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.SS5.p14.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> By Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ A.4 Approximating the Gradient Flow Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, we have that for all <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex439" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex439.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)\right)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)\right)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p14.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p14.2.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex440" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex440.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)\right)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}+\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\varepsilon_{\mathcal{B},\ell}^{(3)}(t)\right)\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{7}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{3}d^{\frac{3}{2}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p14.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p14.3.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, for all <math id="A1.SS5.p14.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}{m^{5}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}^{2}d}{m^{5}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> we shall have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx103" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex441"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex441.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\max\left\{\left|\gamma_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|\zeta_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex441.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},j\in[m^{\star}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex442"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex442.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\max\left\{\left|I_{i,j}^{(1)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(2)}(t)\right|,\left|I_{i,j}^{(3)}(t)\right|\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex442.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{m^{2}}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}\sqrt{d}}\right);\;\forall i,j\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell},i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p14.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p14.4.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bounding <math id="A1.SS5.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span> Here we are going to upper bound <math id="A1.SS5.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS5.p15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[m]\setminus\mathcal{R}_{\ell-1}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma12" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 12</span></span><span id="Thmlemma12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma12.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma12.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma12.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose that the inductive hypothesis in Condition <a href="#Thmcond2" title="Condition 2 (Inductive Hypothesis). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, and the initialization condition in Condition <a href="#Thmcond1" title="Condition 1 (Initialization). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Let <math id="Thmlemma12.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math> be defined in (<a href="#A1.E14" title="In A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>) and <math id="Thmlemma12.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(\xi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(\xi)</annotation></semantics></math> in Definition <a href="#Thmdefin2" title="Definition 2 (Recovery Time). ‣ A.1 Proof Outline ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. Then for all <math id="Thmlemma12.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leq T_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leq T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex443" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex443.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\begin{cases}\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)&amp;\text{ if }i\neq i_{\ell}^{\star}\\
\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)&amp;\text{ if }i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"> if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>≠</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"> if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\begin{cases}\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)&amp;\text{ if }i\neq i_{\ell}^{\star}\\
\mathcal{O}\left(\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)\right)\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)^{2}+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)&amp;\text{ if }i=i_{\ell}^{\star}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.6" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS5.p16" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p16.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p16.1.1" class="ltx_text">By Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ A.4 Approximating the Gradient Flow Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, we have that, in the case where <math id="A1.SS5.p16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq i_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq i_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx104" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex444"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex444.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{d}{dt}\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex444.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\text{sign}\left(I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right)\left(\frac{1}{a_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}+\frac{1}{b_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>sign</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\text{sign}\left(I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right)\left(\frac{1}{a_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{v}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{w}}}_{j}+\frac{1}{b_{i}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{w}}_{i}}{\mathcal{L}}\left(\bm{\theta}(t)\right)^{\top}\bar{{\mathbf{v}}}_{j}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex445"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex445.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq-36C_{S,2}\left(\frac{1}{a_{i}^{2}}+\frac{1}{b_{i}^{2}}\right)\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq-36C_{S,2}\left(\frac{1}{a_{i}^{2}}+\frac{1}{b_{i}^{2}}\right)\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|+\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p16.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.p16.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS5.p16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> is monotonic non-decreasin, we must have that <math id="A1.SS5.p16.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|I_{i,i}^{(3)}(t)\right|\leq\mathcal{O}\left(m\varepsilon_{\mathcal{A},\ell}^{(2)}(t)^{3}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.SS5.p16.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. Similarly, in the case <math id="A1.SS5.p16.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=i_{\ell}^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=i_{\ell}^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that</span></p>
