<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex473.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq\frac{c_{1}^{2}}{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq\frac{c_{1}^{2}}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma13.p2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma13.p2.7.1" class="ltx_text">Thus <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(t+T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)\geq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)+\frac{c_{1}^{2}}{8}\cdot t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(t+T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)\geq\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)+\frac{c_{1}^{2}}{8}\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math>, which implies that <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1,1}\leq T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)+\frac{16}{c_{1}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1,1}\leq T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)+\frac{16}{c_{1}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> since <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)\geq-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>ℙ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}\left(T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right)\geq-\mathcal{O}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{d}}\left(\log\frac{m}{\delta_{\mathbb{P}}}\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> by Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma8" title="Lemma 8. ‣ A.5 Establishing the Inductive Hypothesis: Phase 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of Theorem" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. Therefore, we can conclude that <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1,1},T_{1,2}\leq T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)+\beta_{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1,1},T_{1,2}\leq T\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)+\beta_{8}</annotation></semantics></math> for some constant <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{8}</annotation></semantics></math>. Now, we consider the dynamic of <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(1)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i_{\ell}^{\star},j_{\ell}^{\star}}^{(2)}(t)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="Thmlemma13.p2.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\ geq\max\left\{T_{1,1},T_{1,2}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\ geq\max\left\{T_{1,1},T_{1,2}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math>. As before, we have that</